# The kit is shell and Node scripts that execute on Linux (the dev container, CI) whatever the
# host is, and init.sh runs on the host itself. Pin LF so a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true cannot turn them into CRLF, which bash and sh reject. Git applies this file
# to everything under gauntlet/, so it travels with the kit and needs no project-side seed.
* text=auto eol=lf
